---
import Notebooks from '../../components/Notebooks';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Notebooks"
  description="The analysis notebooks, executed against the current data build after every export."
>
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Notebooks</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">
      Six analyses that run on every published build: whether the board and the Streamers sorts
      pick the right players, what game context, shooting streaks and a teammate's absence are
      worth, and how far the data can be trusted, re-asked of the newest data. Each opens as a rendered page; the source lives in the repository under <code>notebooks/</code>{' '}
      and runs locally, against the published build, or against the lakehouse.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <Notebooks client:only="react" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
